        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-photo" role="img" aria-label="Elegant jewellery"></div>
    </section>

    <div class="trust">
      <div><strong>✨ Anti-Tarnish</strong><span>Made for everyday wear</span></div>
      <div><strong>💗 Skin Friendly</strong><span>Comfort-first designs</span></div>
      <div><strong>📦 Gift Ready</strong><span>Pretty packaging included</span></div>
      <div><strong>🚚 Pan-India</strong><span>We deliver to your door</span></div>
    </div>

    <section id="shop">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div><div class="eyebrow">Shop Pearlhush</div><h2>Made to be worn.</h2></div>
        <p>From everyday chains to statement earrings, find the little piece that feels unmistakably yours.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="filters">
        <button class="filter active" onclick="filterProducts('all',this)">All</button>
